        "no": "01",
        "title": "Quick to see and understand",
        "titleCN": "敏锐的；洞察力强的",
        "definition": "able to notice details and grasp situations quickly and accurately",
        "definitionCN": "能迅速而准确地察觉细节、把握局势",
        "example": "The astute critic spotted the flaw at once.",
        "exampleCN": "敏锐的评论家一眼看出破绽。",
        "why": "From Latin astus, cleverness or craft; the mind moves like a skilled hand.",
